                                <button type="button" onclick="removeTrackMP3(${idx})" style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: #dc2626; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;" title="Gỡ file MP3 khỏi bài hát này">✕ Gỡ MP3</button>
